### 1. GET All Books (Initially Empty Collection)
GET http://localhost:8080/books
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. POST Add Book 1 (Successful Creation - HTTP 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Java Programming",
  "author": "James Gosling",
  "category": "Programming",
  "availableCopies": 5
}

###

### 3. POST Add Book 2 (Successful Creation - HTTP 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "category": "Software Engineering",
  "availableCopies": 3
}

###

### 4. POST Duplicate Book ID (Duplicate Prevention - HTTP 409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Java Programming Duplicate",
  "author": "James Gosling",
  "category": "Programming",
  "availableCopies": 10
}

###

### 5. GET All Books (Retrieve All - HTTP 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/books
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. GET Book by ID (Existing Book - HTTP 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/books/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. GET Book by ID (Non-existent Book - HTTP 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/books/999
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. PUT Update Book by ID (Existing Book - HTTP 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java Programming 2nd Edition",
  "author": "James Gosling",
  "category": "Advanced Programming",
  "availableCopies": 8
}

###

### 9. PUT Update Book by ID (Non-existent Book - HTTP 404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:8080/books/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost Book",
  "author": "Unknown",
  "category": "Mystery",
  "availableCopies": 1
}

###

### 10. DELETE Book by ID (Existing Book - HTTP 200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/books/2
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. DELETE Book by ID (Non-existent Book - HTTP 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/books/999
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. GET All Books (Final Verification - HTTP 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/books
Accept: application/json
